LOGBOOK.md-15-- REVIEW REWORK: CR revision 1 was correctly rejected because the validator admitted a mutant with MTU 1501, packet budget 1, removed notice obligations, and an `unchecked` compatibility condition. The rework pins SHA-256 `fda46421ae6a6c24cf58f5bfb520399b9ebc8d31800b7d61ed18a38231aea43e` over the complete canonical semantic contract. The exact reviewer mutant now exits 1 at `NORMALIZED-CONTRACT` with `productionCompositionPermitted=false`; the unchanged accepted manifest exits 0. The earlier trailing whitespace in the human-readable manifest was removed.
