LOGBOOK.md:1435:### 1010 — Composed M1 runtime harness owns deterministic lifecycle evidence (TASK-260715-m8bi8i)
LOGBOOK.md:1436:- IMPLEMENTATION: The `m1-runtime` command drives `HarnessApplication.run -> HarnessCoreComposition -> DeterministicHarnessSessionFactory -> TunnelRuntimeCoordinator` and the real `BridgeBackedM1PacketPlaneFactory`/`PacketFlowBridge` path against controlled packet, SSH, TCP, safe-DNS, and route substitutes. It observes ordered readiness snapshots, drops a simulated host owner, exchanges one TCP stream and one DNS datagram, requests fixed-schema aggregate diagnostics, and performs reverse cleanup.
